/-!
# A125901

Triangle of the denominators of the almost-harmonic numbers: n-th term in m-th row is denominator of (sum{k=1 to m} 1/k) - 1/n, 1<=n<=m.

The 57 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A125901

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 2, 1, 6, 3, 2, 12, 12, 4, 6,
    60, 60, 20, 30, 12, 20, 20, 60, 5, 4,
    60, 140, 140, 420, 35, 28, 420, 20, 280, 280,
    840, 280, 56, 840, 40, 140, 2520, 2520, 2520, 2520,
